        "On Render, verify is off because there is no Docker"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Prove",
      "items": [
        "Harness fires real concurrent requests",
        "One violating trial proves the defect",
        "Zero violations is bounded evidence only"
